01:46.880 --> 01:48.400
Selamat atas pernikahannya.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.360
Terima kasih.

01:49.520 --> 01:50.680
Selamat atas pernikahannya.

01:50.680 --> 01:51.240
Ayo, pergi.

01:51.240 --> 01:51.960
Hati-hati di jalan.

01:51.960 --> 01:52.720
Biar kuantar kalian.

01:52.720 --> 01:53.160
Kuantar kalian.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.160
Sampai jumpa.

01:54.640 --> 01:55.440
