02:23.800 --> 02:24.130
Baik.

02:24.400 --> 02:24.880
Ayo.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.520
Baik, Kak Wu.

02:25.520 --> 02:26.000
Kalian mengobrollah.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.120
