02:45.960 --> 02:47.490
Kenapa? Kau sudah pacaran?

02:49.880 --> 02:50.520
Ayo.

02:50.640 --> 02:51.360
Kita berdua belum berfoto.

02:51.360 --> 02:52.400
Mari kita berfoto.

02:52.400 --> 02:53.329
Mundur sedikit.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.370
Cahayanya di sini, ayo.

02:55.880 --> 02:58.040
Tiga, dua, satu.

02:59.920 --> 03:00.360
Oke.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.780
Aku unggah di Moments.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.520
Kau pandai pilih tempat.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.980
Tadi Qing Ye duduk di sini.

03:16.760 --> 03:17.280
Oh, ya?

04:26.520 --> 04:27.580
Ibu, biar aku saja.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.650
